WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
People barely use it and there is no electricity for heating.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Moving bones hurts

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Glue sound filling

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Who can withstand this extreme low temperature?

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
No need to deal with the legs

6
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Materials are no different from ice glue

7
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
If you continue to move this leg, it will become completely useless.

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Fever to thirty-nine degrees

9
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,000
I can't find half of the medicine on my legs.

10
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
I can only carry it hard

11
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,130
Blood lasts

12
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:17,130
Neighborhood committees unified material distribution

13
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:19,130
Must be glued to store food at home

14
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:21,220
This is an official failure to cooperate

15
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:23,220
Unified accountability after disasters

16
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:24,220
Don’t fight against the organization

17
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,220
Seal the door

18
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,220
Considering that the family can barely make ends meet

19
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,220
Why glue?

20
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,220
It’s not easy for us to order food at every house

21
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,220
Forcibly confiscating it is too much.

22
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,220
We should help each other before separation

23
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:35,220
It doesn't matter if you eat less and save food

24
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,220
After disobeying the arrangements

25
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,220
will be held accountable

26
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,220
There's no need to mess with the delivery guys

27
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,220
What you say is high-sounding

28
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,220
To put it bluntly, it’s just borrowing

29
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,220
In the name of the neighborhood committee

30
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:46,700
Just searching for supplies, grandma

31
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,700
It's so cold in the room

32
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:49,700
Bear with me a little longer

33
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,700
Grandma tried to find a way to gather more food

34
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,700
Only our grandparents and grandchildren can survive.
